          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Esc キーを打鍵として加えます（Esc を押すと記録をやめるため）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adds Esc as a keystroke, since pressing Esc cancels recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finder で Nonet をアプリケーションフォルダにドラッグしてから、そこから開いてください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In the Finder, drag Nonet to the Applications folder, then open it from there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HUD から実行しました。今度は指を止めずに、すぐにタップしてください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That ran from the HUD. This time, tap right away without resting your finger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HUD が出るまでの時間" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HUD delay"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HUD が出る前に実行されました。今度は指を置いたまま、HUD が出るまで止めてください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That ran before the HUD appeared. This time, keep your finger still until the HUD appears."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HUD で選んだマスを、トリガーキーを離したときに実行します。速押しはどちらでもその場で実行します" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Runs the button you choose in the HUD when you release the trigger key. Quick taps always run right away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HUD で選んだマスを、指を離したときに実行します。やめるときは指を置いたまま左の⇧を押します" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Runs the button you choose in the HUD when you lift your finger. To cancel, keep your finger down and press left ⇧."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HUD の位置" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HUD position"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HUD の大きさ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HUD size"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HUD を出さずに実行したとき、実行したマスを画面の下に一瞬表示します" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When a button runs without the HUD, Nonet briefly shows it at the bottom of the screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HUD を出さずに実行したときと、時間の掛かるボタンが終わったときに、そのボタンを画面の下に表示します" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shows the button at the bottom of the screen when it runs without the HUD, and when a slow button finishes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HUD（9マスの一覧）から選ぶ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose from the HUD (all nine buttons)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HUD（9マスの一覧）で選んだマスを、トリガーキーを離したときに実行します。すぐにタップすれば、HUD が出ていてもその場で実行します" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Runs the button you choose in the HUD (the overview of all nine buttons) when you release the trigger key. A quick tap runs right away, even with the HUD showing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HUD（9マスの一覧）で選んだマスを、指を離したときに実行します。やめるときは指を置いたまま左の⇧を押します" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Runs the button you choose in the HUD (the overview of all nine buttons) when you lift your finger. To cancel, keep your finger down and press left ⇧."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JIS 配列のキーボードには右⌥がありません。右⌘・右⇧・fn のどれかにしてください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "JIS keyboards have no right ⌥. Choose right ⌘, right ⇧ or fn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac にあるアプリから、9マスを用意しました" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nine buttons for the apps on your Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac にログインしたときに Nonet を起動します" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opens Nonet when you log in to your Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac にログインしたら Nonet を自動で起動する" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open Nonet automatically when you log in"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac を手放すときなどに使います。同じキーは、ほかの Mac でもそのまま使えます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use this before you sell or give away this Mac. The same key keeps working on your other Macs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacBook の内蔵トラックパッドか Magic Trackpad が必要です。Magic Trackpad をつないでも反応しないときは、Nonet を終了して起動し直してください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nonet needs a MacBook's built-in trackpad or a Magic Trackpad. If your Magic Trackpad doesn't respond after you connect it, quit and reopen Nonet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NONET_PROJECT_DIR と同じ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Same as NONET_PROJECT_DIR"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NONET_SELECTED_TEXT と NONET_BROWSER_URL は、スクリプトの中（コメントでもかまいません）にその名前があるときだけ設定されます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NONET_SELECTED_TEXT and NONET_BROWSER_URL are set only when the script mentions their names (a comment is enough)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nonet" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
